Hello all Gore Doctor fans!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44342000/428ee838862f746dd4957accb590fcb2caf860a1.png

We are happy to inform that a new version of Gore Doctor is available for Windows (with Linux to follow within an hour or two).

Here are the main changes:

- Solved issue when in certain scenarios some items from the inventory would disappear;
- Added a few hints in "Awakening" and "Sanctum of Madness" locations;
- Fixed an issue in "Sanctum of Madness" when after providing electricity to the door, the hint still informed that one needs to provide electricity;
- Added extra textures to enemies clothing;
- Using Alt-Tab now pauses the game, so the game does not force moving to the next scene after loading;
- Changed number of bullets in the pistol on "Awakening" location so it matches all other scenes;
- Some other small fixes here and there.

Today you can also expect an extra update (1.11) that will take care of some minor issues.

Thank you for your support!
